<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, D.C. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Wednesday</p>
<p>at the $675,000 Legg Mason Tennis Classic (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Doug Flach (U.S.) beat 3-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 2-6 6-4 6-4.</p>
<p>8-Thomas Haas (Germany) beat Mark Merklein (U.S.) 6-4 2-6</p>
<p>6-3.</p>
<p>Michael Tebbutt (Australia) beat 4-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3.</p>
<p>14-Vince Spadea (U.S.) beat Bryan Shelton (U.S.) 6-4 6-4.</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat 12-Marzio Martelli (Italy) 7-5 6-1.</p>
<p>11-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Andrej Meriniv (Russia)</p>
<p>6-0 6-1.</p>
<p>Ranier Schuttler (Germany) beat Marcus Hilpert (Germany) 7-5,</p>
<p>6-2.</p>
<p>Steve Campbell (U.S.) beat Ben Ellwood (Australia) 6-4 4-6</p>
<p>6-3.</p>
<p>16-Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) beat Davide Scala (Italy) 7-6</p>
<p>6-4.</p>
<p>9-Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Gianluca Pozzi (Italy) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0.</p>
</text>
